      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents, The Dublin Property Experts, are delighted to present No. 53 Kells Road to the Crumlin property market.\r\n\r\nUpon entering this charming home, you are welcomed by a compact but well utilised and inviting hallway . To the front lies a well-proportioned living room, offering a comfortable and relaxing space. Continuing through, you will find a stylish family bathroom. To the rear, the property opens into a spacious kitchen and dining area, ideal for both everyday living and entertaining, with direct access to the garden. Upstairs, the accommodation comprises two generous double bedrooms.\r\n\r\nNo. 53 further benefits from a spacious south-facing rear garden, providing a private outdoor retreat perfect for relaxation or hosting guests.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned within a quiet and highly sought-after residential cul-de-sac, the property is located just 3.9km from St. Stephen’s Green and is exceptionally well-served by a range of reliable bus routes. The M50 motorway is also within a convenient 10-minute drive, offering excellent connectivity to the wider Dublin area.\r\n\r\nThis mature and established neighbourhood boasts an abundance of local amenities, including shops, supermarkets, parklands, cafés, bars, and restaurants, all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and can be arranged at your earliest convenience.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nAll details are provided to the best of our knowledge. While every effort has been made to ensure accuracy, some information may have been supplied by the vendor. We accept no liability for any errors or omissions in our marketing material and advise interested parties to seek independent professional advice."
